<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<wodefinitions>
	<wo class="ERXElse" content="expected" unknownAttributes="forbidden">

		<doc><![CDATA[Renders its content when the conditional just before it didn't: the "else" of an `ERXWOConditional` (`<wo:if>`). Written as `<wo:else>`.

```html
<wo:if condition="$hasItems">…</wo:if>
<wo:else>No items</wo:else>
```

It must follow a conditional; used without one it throws.]]></doc>

	</wo>
</wodefinitions>
